# Generated Rust and native image artifacts (including standalone test fixtures).
**/target/
/build/
/dist/
/results/
/working/
/transfer/
# Generated rustdoc, refreshed by cargo xtask doc/check.
/docs/api/
/.toolchains/
# Private VM media and machine-local state.
*.qcow2
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.rom
*.log
.hfs*
# The board's own firmware, supplied by the developer from the firmware
# distribution. Redistributable only unmodified and only for its own hardware,
# with the licence travelling alongside, so it is build input and never
# repository content. The image carries it; the checkout does not.
/firmware/
# Editor, Python and OS caches.
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
/status.txt
